'''Berreyarza''' (from [[Basque language|Basque]] ''berreiarza''; {{Literally|spirit of the bear|}}) is a [[Planned communities in Balisca|planned community]] and [[Communes of Balisca|barrio]] located on the [[tba]] peninsula of the [[Trinacria]] borough, within the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. It has rapidly evolved into a lively neighborhood of housing cooperatives, hospitals, and [[W:Biotechnology|biotechnology]] research and development. From 2015 to 2025, Berreyarza's population has increased by over 200%.  

